  "summary": "Written by Daryl Dawson, RN Urinary tract infections are one of the most common infections out there, but did you know that one of the easiest ways to prevent a UTI is as simple as sipping on water? Yep, staying hydrated could be your first line of defense. Water doesn’t just keep you feeling refreshed—it’s […]",
